# C2: mlmf-meta's direct dependencies. Changing this file is a deliberate
# act. Keep sorted -- `deps.rs::direct_dependencies_match_allowlist`
# compares against the manifest's sorted dependency list with `assert_eq!`
# over a VECTOR, not a set, so an entry in the wrong position fails exactly
# as a missing one does.
#
# C4 is why `mlmf-core` is the only entry this crate may ever have: this
# crate names no format crate. It holds the spec §5 vocabulary as a data
# table, and a table row saying GGUF spells a key `tokenizer.chat_template`
# is not format knowledge -- an edge to mlmf-gguf, which WOULD be, is the
# thing this list exists to refuse.
mlmf-core
